>>> x3(to look at)....... a microbe..... right?
>>>
>>
>> If you really want to use pilno as your selbri:
>>
>> pilno: x1 uses/employs x2 for purpose x3.
>> The x3 of pilno is what the x2 is being used by x1 for. This is usually
